{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15981","headline":"赠离曲 · 王建","name":"赠离曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合欢叶堕梧桐秋，鸳鸯背飞水分流。\n少年使我忽相弃，雌号雄鸣夜悠悠。\n夜长月没虫切切，冷风入房灯焰灭。\n若知中路各西东，彼此不忘同心结。\n收取头边蛟龙枕，留着箱中双雉裳。\n我今焚却旧房物，免使他人登尔牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}